1
00:00:00,202 --> 00:00:03,872
(Penny:)Okay, I got a box, but there's no key
in here. Just letters.

2
00:00:04,039 --> 00:00:05,669
(Sheldon:)That's the wrong box. Put it back.

3
00:00:05,832 --> 00:00:08,582
(Penny:)Oh, Sheldon, are these letters
from your grandmother?

4
00:00:08,752 --> 00:00:10,172
(Sheldon:)Don't read those letters.

5
00:00:10,337 --> 00:00:13,467
(Penny:)Oh, look, she calls you Moon Pie.
That is so cute.

6
00:00:13,632 --> 00:00:15,632
[SHRIEKING]
Put down the letters!

7
00:00:18,845 --> 00:00:20,175
(Leonard:)Hey, Penny. It's Leonard.

8
00:00:20,347 --> 00:00:21,977
(Penny:)Hey, Leonard. How's the train ride?

9
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:25,600
Delightful. I don't know
what you're doing right now...

10
00:00:25,769 --> 00:00:29,189
(Leonard:)...but there are little bubbles forming
in the corner of Sheldon's mouth.

11
00:00:29,356 --> 00:00:32,236
(Penny:)Okay. Yeah, I kind of crossed a line.
Put him back on.

12
00:00:32,401 --> 00:00:33,651
(Leonard:)Thank you.

13
00:00:35,028 --> 00:00:37,738
- I'm back.
- What up, Moon Pie?

14
00:00:38,323 --> 00:00:41,703
No one calls me Moon Pie but Meemaw.

15
00:00:43,412 --> 00:00:45,662
(Leonard:)Hey, Penny. Leonard again.

16
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:50,750
(Howard:)So anyway, in the dream, you and I
were ice skating, just the two of us.

17
00:00:50,919 --> 00:00:53,129
(Howard:)And then I picked you up
by your ankles...

18
00:00:53,296 --> 00:00:59,026
(Howard:)...and twirled you round and round
until your legs tore off.

